    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105166" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρί̆-πολις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with three cities,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νᾶσος,</span> of Rhodes, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Scyl.
				99
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρίπολις, ἡ,</span>
			<i>league of three cities,</i> as in Achaea, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.81.7
			</span></i>, etc.; in Arcadia, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				8.27.4
			</span></i>; in Phoenicia, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				16.41
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind
			of cake, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
